:name: TEST-PIX-032 probe — WHERE does the falcon cascade actually use stack?
:description: Paints the two regions naive stack-painting would target and reports which,
:description: if either, execution touches. Answers a prerequisite of relay P06 rather than
:description: assuming it: measuring the wrong region yields a misleading zero.

using sysbus
mach create "hwprobe"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @hardware/renode/pixhawk6xrt.repl
sysbus LoadELF @hardware/renode/cascade-m7/falcon-cascade-m7.elf

# region A — ARM hardware stack (512 B below initial SP)
sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x2001FFFC 0xDEADBEEF
